            <title>[IGNITE-175] Need to move IgniteCompute API to use IgniteCallable and IgniteRunnable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-175</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently IgniteCompute uses Callable and Runnable, however Callable and Runnable are not Serializable and not supported by Java 8 lambdas for distribution and require special casting to Serializable.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
